{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"DAN","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"但以理书","commonName":"但以理书","title":"但以理书","order":27,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"a4be92de31b1c186cc26be9ce436de1d5a9f2557a06afacf3acf2e575d823a06","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/DAN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/DAN/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":355},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["末日"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["“那时，守护你同胞的天使长米迦勒必挺身而出。将有一段灾难时期，是开国以来从未有过的。那时，你同胞中凡名字记在册子上的，必得拯救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["许多长眠地下的人必醒过来，有些得到永生，有些蒙受羞辱，永远被憎恶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["智者必发出光辉，如耀眼的穹苍；引导多人归向公义的人必如闪亮的星辰，直到永永远远。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["但以理啊，这些话要保密，要把这书封起来，直到末了。许多人必四处探究，因而知识必增多。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我但以理观看，看见另有两个人分别站在河的两岸。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["其中一人问身穿细麻衣、站在河水之上的人：“这奇异的事何时才应验呢？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我听见身穿细麻衣、站在河水之上的人向天举起双手，凭永活者起誓说：“再过三年半，等摧毁圣民的权势结束时，这一切事都要成就。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我听见这话，却不明白，就问他：“我主啊，这些事的结局会怎样呢？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他说：“但以理啊，你走吧，因为这些事要保密，要被封起来，一直到末了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["许多人必被净化、洗涤、炼净。但恶人必依旧作恶，他们无人明白，只有智者能明白。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["从废除日常献的祭、设立带来毁灭的可憎之物算起，必经过一千二百九十天。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["能等候一千三百三十五天的人有福了！"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你要坚持到底。你必得到安息，到了末后的日子，你必起来承受你的产业。”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/DAN/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/DAN/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}